2025-11-19 11:12:26,522 - INFO - Reduce阶段：筛选出 8 个高质量关键点，内容如下：[{'answer': '吉布斯自由能（E1）是过程自发性（E12）和相行为（通过决定相图中溶质线（E23）的形状）的主要决定因素。 [cite: chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-6, chunk-c650f431ab1a64d79a04fd78129b8b47-e-4, chunk-c650f431ab1a64d79a04fd78129b8b47-r-2, chunk-4f3d16b86d81754dbaf81c3cd72ad236-e-3, chunk-4f3d16b86d81754dbaf81c3cd72ad236-r-3]', 'score': 10}, {'answer': '吉布斯能量曲线是构建相图的理论基础，它决定了不同温度下相的稳定性。这些能量曲线是为特定温度计算的，并适用于液相和固相。 [cite: chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-e-4, chunk-48ca45563a55f596e71add250d8f0736-e-8, chunk-48ca45563a55f596e71add250d8f0736-e-10, chunk-dcbd28286d989a0eb66fc73e40eae358-r-1, chunk-48ca45563a55f596e71add250d8f0736-r-9, chunk-dcbd28286d989a0eb66fc73e40eae358-r-3, chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-r-4, chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-r-5]', 'score': 10}, {'answer': '吉布斯自由能（E1）由焓（E2）和内能（E3）共同定义。 [cite: chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-6, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-8, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-9, chunk-bec464d98efbb845e52cbc4d8406ffee-r-2, chunk-bec464d98efbb845e52cbc4d8406ffee-r-1]', 'score': 9}, {'answer': '吉布斯自由能（E1）最终由焓（E2）定义。 [cite: chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-6, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-8, chunk-bec464d98efbb845e52cbc4d8406ffee-r-2]', 'score': 9}, {'answer': '吉布斯能量曲线上的切点是确定相平衡的关键，这些点被直接转移到相图上，成为定义液相线和固相线的点，从而将热力学计算与相边界联系起来。 [cite: chunk-dcbd28286d989a0eb66fc73e40eae358-r-4, chunk-dcbd28286d989a0eb66fc73e40eae358-e-5, chunk-f037804be3c04853a00bdfd6e3ae2697-e-9, chunk-f037804be3c04853a00bdfd6e3ae2697-e-10, chunk-f037804be3c04853a00bdfd6e3ae2697-r-8, chunk-f037804be3c04853a00bdfd6e3ae2697-r-7, chunk-f037804be3c04853a00bdfd6e3ae2697-r-6]', 'score': 9}, {'answer': '吉布斯自由能（E1）的定义也包含了压力（E4）和体积（E8）的贡献。 [cite: chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-6, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-10, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-7, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-r-9, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-r-10]', 'score': 8}, {'answer':