2025-11-19 11:21:52,201 - INFO - 全局搜索生成的答案: 吉布斯自由能（E1）是一个关键的热力学量，它由焓（E2）和内能（E3）共同定义 [cite: chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-6, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-8, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-9, chunk-bec464d98efbb845e52cbc4d8406ffee-r-2, chunk-bec464d98efbb845e2cbc4d8406ffee-r-1]。其定义还包含了压力（E4）和体积（E8）的贡献 [cite: chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-6, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-10, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-7, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-r-9, chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-r-10]。

在热力学过程中，吉布斯自由能（E1）的负变化表示该过程是一个自发过程（E12）[cite: chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-6, chunk-c650f431ab1a64d79a04fd78129b8b47-e-4, chunk-c650f431ab1a64d79a04fd78129b8b47-r-2]。

吉布斯能量曲线是构建相图的理论基础，它决定了不同温度下相的稳定性 [cite: chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-e-4, chunk-48ca45563a55f596e71add250d8f0736-e-8, chunk-48ca45563a55f596e71add250d8f0736-e-10, chunk-dcbd28286d989a0eb66fc73e40eae358-r-1, chunk-48ca45563a55f596e71add250d8f0736-r-9, chunk-dcbd28286d989a0eb66fc73e40eae358-r-3, chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-r-4, chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-r-5]。吉布斯自由能（E1）的应用价值还体现在决定相图中溶质线（E23）的形状，并包含混合能（E21）和组分能量（E22）[cite: chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-6, chunk-4f3d16b86d81754dbaf81c3cd72ad236-e-3, chunk-4f3d16b86d81754dbaf81c3cd72ad236-e-7, chunk-4f3d16b86d81754dbaf81c3cd72ad236-e-6, chunk-4f3d16b86d81754dbaf81c3cd72ad236-r-3, chunk-4f3d16b86d81754dbaf81c3cd72ad236-r-5, chunk-4f3d16b86d81754dbaf81c3cd72ad236-r-6]。此外，吉布斯能量曲线上的公切点直接映射为相图上的固相线和液相线，从而将热力学计算与相边界联系起来 [cite: chunk-dcbd28286d989a0eb66fc73e40eae358-r-4, chunk-dcbd28286d989a0eb66fc73e40eae358-e-5, chunk-f037804be3c04853a00bdfd6e3ae2697-e-9, chunk-f037804be3c04853a00bdfd6e3ae2697-e-10, chunk-f037804be3c04853a00bdfd6e3ae2697-r-8, chunk-f037804be3c04853a00bdfd6e3ae2697-r-7, chunk-f037804be3c04853a00bdfd6e3ae2697-r-6, chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-e-8, chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-e-7, chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-r-6, chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-r-8, chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-r-7, chunk-d9a7d9e2a990c361dfd40d3d31ddbba7-r-9]。吉布斯自由能（E1）的计算结果可以可视化为图13(a)至(e) [cite: chunk-249c8ea554b5551118a4409d25c9f905-e-6, chunk-6b41d5e2fe1cf5ac74ca648dd47fa2cc-e-9, chunk-6b41d5e2fe1cf5ac74ca648dd47fa2cc-r-10]。
